==Trivia==
*His design is based on Christ's depiction in ''[[wikipedia:The Last Judgment (Michelangelo)|The Last Judgment]]'' by Michelangelo.
* During the third hit of his attack, his pose is almost the same as [[jojowiki:Kars|Ultimate Kars]]' [[jojowiki:File:Kars OP.png|pose]] in the second ''[[wikipedia:JoJo's Bizarre Adventure|JoJo's Bizarre Adventure]]'' opening, "[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmpJqJLsR48&pp=ygUNYmxvb2R5IHN0cmVhbQ%3D%3D BLOODY STREAM]".
*Prior to the [[Enemy Guide]] rework in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Final Boss Giga-God had a joke "trait" named Cool Dude, poking fun at how he often breaks the 4th wall. His name in the Enemy Guide was Final Boss Cat God (Cool Dude), despite being [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. [[Cat God]] also shared this distinction.
*As with all of his equivalents from [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]], Final Boss Giga-God's description breaks the fourth wall, talking about the last [[Cats of the Cosmos]] chapter.

